			{
				"type": "CSSComment",
				"value": " an unquoted `url()` is opaque to the value reader and transparent to the media\n\treader's number pass, so one authoring has two canonical forms ",
				"start": 9,
				"end": 157
			},
			{
				"type": "CSSComment",
				"value": " the media reader's number pass runs in value position only, so a `url()` in name\n\tposition keeps its content whichever reader is asked ",
				"start": 267,
				"end": 407
			}
		],
		"content": {
			"start": 7,
			"end": 461,
			"styles": "\n\t/* an unquoted `url()` is opaque to the value reader and transparent to the media\n\treader's number pass, so one authoring has two canonical forms */\n\t@supports (a: url(1.50)) {\n\t\tb {\n\t\t\tcolor: red;\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\t@media (a: url(1.5)) {\n\t\tb {\n\t\t\tcolor: red;\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\t/* the media reader's number pass runs in value position only, so a `url()` in name\n\tposition keeps its content whichever reader is asked */\n\t@media (url(1.50): a) {\n\t\tb {\n\t\t\tcolor: red;\n\t\t}\n\t}\n",
			"comment": null
		}
